旅游\n白富美、高富帅\n……\n日常生活中你都搞不定，你去东南亚就能搞定？好事能轮到你吗？\n\n有些人，有些事，没办法……","raw_text":{"text":"突发：深圳一美女又被经泰国骗去妙瓦底了，本月第三例登上热门事件\n\n受害者\n27岁深圳女子符悦\n赴泰见网友失联，其实就是谈恋爱了！\n\n其最后位置在泰国来兴府一处蜜雪冰城服务区，该地点直行清迈左拐即通往泰缅边境湄索，过去就是妙瓦底。\n此后她被控制并遭看守人声称：“花费数十万买过去的”。\n\n这个基本上没救了，\n一旦进了妙瓦底，能活着就算是她运气好，很难健全回国了。\n\n高薪、恋爱、旅游\n白富美、高富帅\n……\n日常生活中你都搞不定，你去东南亚就能搞定？好事能轮到你吗？\n\n有些人，有些事，没办法……","display_text_range":[0,246],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[142,165],"id":"2119753252195680256","display":"pic.x.com/WB5bFz6MpW","original":"https://t.co/WB5bFz6MpW","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2119753282315055332/photo/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[142,165],"id":"2119753265323925504","display":"pic.x.com/WB5bFz6MpW","original":"https://t.co/WB5bFz6MpW","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2119753282315055332/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"btcmos","url":"https://x.com/btcmos","id":"1865722200185307136","followers":61793,"following":28944,"likes":126239,"media_count":969,"statuses":9027,"name":"香港老雷","description":"美股老韭｜BTC玩家｜加密合约｜AI资讯|AI投资｜数据整理｜WEIBO：香港老雷","raw_description":{"text":"美股老韭｜BTC玩家｜加密合约｜AI资讯|AI投资｜数据整理｜WEIBO：香港老雷","facets":[]},"location":"Japan","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1888127766488625152/Fiba7f5J_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Dec 08 11:37:14 +0000 2024","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":87,"reposts":39,"likes":252,"bookmarks":84,"quotes":7,"embed_card":"summary_large_image","created_at":"Mon Nov 09 11:25:40 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1794223540,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":83864,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"zh","replying_to":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"photo","id":"2119753252195680256","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWrgWhiaQAAp20P.jpg?name=orig","width":987,"height":1482},{"type":"photo","id":"2119753265323925504","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWrgXScbYAAviwt.jpg?name=orig","width":1269,"height":1